# Build artifacts of the playground-web crate itself. The root .gitignore's
# `/target` covers only the workspace root, so this crate ignores its own
# output here; its Cargo.lock is already covered by the root rules. The
# .wasm copied into web/ by build.sh is a build artifact too — the static
# site is reproduced from source, never committed as a binary.
/target
/web/*.wasm
